{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "把 1、4、9 看作可重复使用的选择，令 dp[i] 表示凑出 i 所需的最少完全平方数个数。动画依次计算 1 到 12，并用递推式 dp[i] = min(dp[i - j²] + 1) 选择最优前驱。最终 dp[12] = 3，对应 12 = 4 + 4 + 4；同理计算到 13 时会得到 4 + 9，共 2 个。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>完全平方数动态规划演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.mono,.value,.formula{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff}\n.squares{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.square{padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:11px}\n.formula-box{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d2d;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.card{flex:1 1 120px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;min-height:44px}\n.card-label{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:2px}\n.card-value{font-size:12px;color:#d4d4d4}\n.dp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,38px);gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}\n.cell .index{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.cell.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.current .value{color:#fff}\n.cell.previous{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.pending .value{color:#8d8d8d}\n.explain{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d2d;border-radius:4px;min-height:36px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.result{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}\n.term{padding:2px 7px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;color:#fff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px}\n.plus{color:#8d8d8d}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>凑出 <span class=\"accent mono\">n = 12</span></h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">dp[i] = min(dp[i−j²]+1)，j² ≤ i</p>\n<div class=\"squares\"><div class=\"square mono\">1²=1</div><div class=\"square mono\">2²=4</div><div class=\"square mono\">3²=9</div></div>\n<div class=\"formula-box mono\">dp[0]=0</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">计算</div><div class=\"card-value mono\" id=\"target\">dp[1]</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">选择</div><div class=\"card-value mono\" id=\"choice\">1 = 0 + 1</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">最少个数</div><div class=\"card-value mono accent\" id=\"best\">1</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"dp-grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n<div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\">从 dp[0] 加上 1²，得到 dp[1] = 1。</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"result\"><span class=\"term\">12</span><span class=\"plus\">=</span><span class=\"term\">4</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"term\">4</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span><span class=\"term\">4</span></div>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"mono\">dp[12]=3</span>；n=13 时为 <span class=\"mono\">4+9 → 2</span></p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst n=12,dp=Array(n+1).fill(Infinity),frames=[];dp[0]=0;\nframes.push({i:0,prev:null,sq:0,best:0,values:[...dp],text:'空和不需要任何平方数, dp[0]=0; 其他状态尚未计算.'});\nfor(let i=1;i<=n;i++)for(let j=1;j*j<=i;j++){\n const sq=j*j,prev=i-sq,candidate=dp[prev]+1,before=dp[i];dp[i]=Math.min(dp[i],candidate);\n frames.push({i,prev,sq,best:dp[i],values:[...dp],text:`尝试 ${sq}: dp[${prev}]+1=${candidate}; min(${before===Infinity?'∞':before}, ${candidate})=${dp[i]}.`});\n}\nframes.push({i:n,prev:null,sq:0,best:dp[n],values:[...dp],done:true,text:'所有候选都比较完毕: dp[12]=3, 即 4+4+4. 时间 O(n√n), 空间 O(n).'});\nconst grid=document.getElementById('grid');\nfor(let i=0;i<=n;i++){const c=document.createElement('div');c.className='cell';c.innerHTML='<div class=\"index\">'+i+'</div><div class=\"value\">?</div>';grid.appendChild(c);}\nlet step=0;\nfunction render(){const f=frames[step];\n [...grid.children].forEach((c,i)=>{c.className='cell'+(f.values[i]===Infinity?' pending':'')+(i===f.i?' current':'')+(i===f.prev?' previous':'');c.querySelector('.value').textContent=f.values[i]===Infinity?'?':f.values[i];});\n document.getElementById('target').textContent='dp['+f.i+']';\n document.getElementById('choice').textContent=f.sq?f.i+' = '+f.prev+' + '+f.sq:(f.done?'所有候选已比较':'初始化');\n document.getElementById('best').textContent=f.best;document.getElementById('explain').textContent=f.text;\n document.getElementById('progress').style.width=((step+1)/frames.length*100)+'%';step=(step+1)%frames.length;\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1500);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(n√n)","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为目标整数. 对每个金额 i 枚举不超过 √i 的平方数, dp 保存 0 到 n 的最少个数."}
